{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start your engines \u2014 with your keyboard.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966170/extras/b7695f2cedc6ef656d5406ec550d8d58.poster.avif?t=1764669582\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966170/extras/b7695f2cedc6ef656d5406ec550d8d58.webm?t=1764669582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966170/extras/b7695f2cedc6ef656d5406ec550d8d58.mp4?t=1764669582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Type Drivers</strong>, the speed of your car is the speed of your typing. Race against rivals or challenge yourself in solo runs where every word counts. The faster and more accurate you type, the faster your car tears down the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win races, earn money, and unlock your garage full of options. Customize your ride with fresh paint jobs, rims, and cosmetics to show off your style. But speed is more than cosmetics \u2014 every car in the store has a required typing speed. Reach the minimum WPM and you\u2019ll be able to buy it \u2014 if you\u2019ve got the cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to climb from a rusty starter car to the fastest machine on the track? Or will another typer leave you in the dust?<br><br><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Type to race</strong> \u2014 your typing speed is your car speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive multiplayer &amp; solo runs</strong> \u2014 race rivals online or practice against the clock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn and spend</strong> \u2014 win money from races to upgrade your garage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your ride</strong> \u2014 paint jobs, rims, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new cars</strong> \u2014 meet typing speed requirements and prove your skill to drive faster machines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast hands win races. Accuracy brings victory. Can you handle the pressure of the ultimate typing showdown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966170?t=1764669582","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966170?t=1764669582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966170/81a34fea77b1a0a12aebf1de7e0edd1df8e1cbc1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764669582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966170/81a34fea77b1a0a12aebf1de7e0edd1df8e1cbc1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764669582","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start your engines \u2014 with your keyboard.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966170/extras/b7695f2cedc6ef656d5406ec550d8d58.poster.avif?t=1764669582\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966170/extras/b7695f2cedc6ef656d5406ec550d8d58.webm?t=1764669582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966170/extras/b7695f2cedc6ef656d5406ec550d8d58.mp4?t=1764669582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Type Drivers</strong>, the speed of your car is the speed of your typing. Race against rivals or challenge yourself in solo runs where every word counts. The faster and more accurate you type, the faster your car tears down the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win races, earn money, and unlock your garage full of options. Customize your ride with fresh paint jobs, rims, and cosmetics to show off your style. But speed is more than cosmetics \u2014 every car in the store has a required typing speed. Reach the minimum WPM and you\u2019ll be able to buy it \u2014 if you\u2019ve got the cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to climb from a rusty starter car to the fastest machine on the track? Or will another typer leave you in the dust?<br><br><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Type to race</strong> \u2014 your typing speed is your car speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive multiplayer &amp; solo runs</strong> \u2014 race rivals online or practice against the clock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn and spend</strong> \u2014 win money from races to upgrade your garage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your ride</strong> \u2014 paint jobs, rims, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new cars</strong> \u2014 meet typing speed requirements and prove your skill to drive faster machines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast hands win races. Accuracy brings victory. Can you handle the pressure of the ultimate typing showdown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Toonik Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"descriptio